Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,we're in a technology
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.88,0:00:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,revolution. And many people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,thought that the internet
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,was a technology revolution,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and to some extent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,it was. But today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of just one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,major platform evolving, we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.27,0:00:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,have five. So robotics,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.69,0:00:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,energy storage, AI, blockchain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.51,0:00:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,technology, and multi-omic sequencing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,in the life science
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,space, which we believe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,is the most profound
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.96,0:00:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,application of AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,healthcare. And so this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,boom, if you look
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,back at the railroad
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,boom, the amount of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,investment that we saw
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.16,0:00:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,back then was about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.36,0:00:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,6% of GDP at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.14,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,its peak, 5% to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,6%. The internet boom
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.83,0:00:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,was more like the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.10,0:00:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,auto boom in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,early 1900s. It was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,more in the 3%
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.95,0:00:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,to 4% of GDP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,range. We believe this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,five-platform innovation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,strategy or boom is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:00:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,going to move to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.08,0:01:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,12% of GDP.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.86,0:01:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And we do believe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,also that
